== Overview ==
The '''Large Astro Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] that was added in the [[Episode 75 Update]].

This Astro Toilet has 172,241,456 base HP, with only one player in the match. Using this math, two players would double the HP, and so on.

== Appearance ==
The Large Astro Toilet is a big black toilet, with a turret on the bottom and two large wings, each having four lasers and 2 winglets, To top it off, the Large Astro Toilet is equipped with a helmet and has two smaller winglets next to either side of it's head.

